      "id": "sol.amc-12a-2006-p3.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Mary’s age is \\(\\tfrac{3}{5}\\) of Alice’s, so Mary is \\(\\tfrac{3}{5}\\cdot 30 = 18\\) years old.\n\nThus, the correct answer is B.",
